### 外部前置条件：需要 Elasticsearch 8.17.0 且已安装同版本 IK 插件。
### 入库使用 ik_max_word 建立更细粒度词条，查询使用 ik_smart 减少无效组合。

### 1. 确认 IK 插件已安装
GET http://localhost:9200/_cat/plugins?v

### 2. 对照：standard 对中文支持有限
POST http://localhost:9200/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analyzer": "standard",
  "text": "Elasticsearch RAG 混合检索知识库"
}

### 3. 索引阶段的细粒度分词
POST http://localhost:9200/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analyzer": "ik_max_word",
  "text": "Elasticsearch RAG 混合检索知识库"
}

### 4. 查询阶段的智能分词
POST http://localhost:9200/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analyzer": "ik_smart",
  "text": "Elasticsearch RAG 混合检索知识库"
}

### 5. 创建使用 IK 双分词策略的索引
PUT http://localhost:9200/life_note
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "title": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "ik_max_word",
        "search_analyzer": "ik_smart"
      },
      "content": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "ik_max_word",
        "search_analyzer": "ik_smart"
      },
      "type": { "type": "keyword" },
      "author": { "type": "keyword" },
      "record_time": { "type": "date" }
    }
  }
}

### 6. 写入中文生活笔记
PUT http://localhost:9200/life_note/_doc/3001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "健康饮食与居家养生",
  "content": "规律作息、清淡饮食，多吃蔬菜水果，合理运动",
  "type": "健康生活",
  "author": "生活达人",
  "record_time": "2026-04-27"
}

### 7. IK 分词检索；结果默认由 BM25 计算相关性分数
GET http://localhost:9200/life_note/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": { "content": "健康 作息 旅行" }
  }
}
